    "written_radical": "艸 (grass/plant)",
    "kangxi_radical_number": 140,
    "unihan_kRSUnicode": "140.12",
    "unihan_cite": "Unicode Unihan, marking/tools/vectors/Unihan_IRGSources.txt: 'U+856D\tkRSUnicode\t140.12' (Kangxi radical 140 = 艸/grass-plant, +12 residual strokes; kTotalStrokes 16). Radical 140 is a PLANT_RADICAL (trait_labelers.PLANT_RADICALS = {140,75,118,115,119,97,179,200,202}); the known plant char 菊 (chrysanthemum, U+83CA) is kRSUnicode 140.8 — same radical.",
    "moe_radical_field": "艸",
    "moe_sense_noun_1": "一種香草。即艾蒿。《說文解字．艸部》：「蕭，艾蒿也。」《詩經．王風．采葛》：「彼采蕭兮，一日不見，如三秋兮。」",
    "moe_cite": "MOE 《重編國語辭典修訂本》 s.v. 蕭 (字詞號 07008), 部首字=艸, 釋義 [名]1: 一種香草，即艾蒿 (a kind of aromatic herb, i.e. artemisia / mugwort), citing 《說文解字．艸部》「蕭，艾蒿也」 (Shuowen Jiezi, artemisia in the 艸-radical section) and 《詩經．王風．采葛》「彼采蕭兮」 (Shijing: 'there he gathers artemisia'). The MOE 部首字 (radical) field agrees with Unihan: 艸.",
    "shuowen_cite": "《說文解字．艸部》：「蕭，艾蒿也。」 — Shuowen Jiezi (Xu Shen, c. 100 CE), the foundational Chinese etymological dictionary, classes 蕭 under the 艸 (grass/plant) radical section and glosses it 艾蒿 (artemisia). This is the WRITTEN-channel plant charge: the graph's radical + its founding etymological gloss.",
    "note": "蕭 is the sole plant-radical character in the poem's 8 lines. Its plant sense is the artemisia (艾蒿 / 香草) noun sense, carried by the 艸 radical and the Shuowen gloss. THE WORD 蕭蕭 (reduplicated) is read as ONOMATOPOEIA — the rustling of wind / the whinnying of horses (MOE 釋義 [形]1 寂寥冷清 '蕭瑟'/'蕭條' is the desolate-sound adjective sense; here 蕭蕭 modifies 班馬鳴, the horses' neighing). So the SOUND is what the reduplicated word realizes; the plant is the graph's latent botanical sense. BUT SEE CRITICAL_HONESTY_NOTE: the live descriptive plant labeler (Erya 釋草 ∧ radical 140) promotes this very plant charge to the WORD tier, so on this board the zh plant is STATED, not latent."
   }
  ],
  "why": "the live zh written-plant inventory (hownet_plant_chars_54.json) is HowNet-sememe-based and simplified-dominant; HowNet has 蕭='{character|文字...}' and 萧='{desolate|荒}/{surname|姓}' — no plant sememe; 蕭/萧 both absent from the 259 charged chars. Board-local supplies 蕭's radical."
 },
